WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.600
In the year 589, the armies of the Sui dynasty launched their attack on the Chen dynasty in the south.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.414
The warships were lined up in neat order, and the soldiers' fighting spirit was high.

00:00:11.764 --> 00:00:16.708
The great army crossed the Yangtze River, and the Chen armies could not stop them.

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:20.874
Horns sounded, and the fleet of boats sped forward.

00:00:21.224 --> 00:00:25.256
The last emperor of Chen hid in a well, and was found by the Sui soldiers.

00:00:25.606 --> 00:00:28.198
He trembled with fright and did not dare make a sound.

00:00:28.548 --> 00:00:32.316
The Sui army entered Jiankang, and the Chen dynasty came to an end.

00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:36.530
The people in the city lined the streets to welcome the new army.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.712
Emperor Wen of Sui completed the reunification, and north and south came once again under a single central government.

00:00:43.062 --> 00:00:45.750
The ministers congratulated the emperor one after another.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:50.396
The long division came to an end, and China welcomed peace.

00:00:50.746 --> 00:00:53.914
Laughter was heard again in the fields.

